[{"id":37,"url":"4c32c9a7-afa5-463c-88a0-c426b0c4c844","subject":"S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Will - Ph\u1ea7n 1","content":[{"contentHtml":"<p><strong>A.<\/strong> Ch\u00fang ta s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"> <\/span><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Will <\/strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">( vi\u1ebft t\u1eaft l\u00e0 <\/span><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">'ll<\/strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"> )<\/span> khi ch\u00fang ta quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3 t\u1ea1i th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u00f3i:<\/p><ul><li>Oh, I left the door open. I <strong>will (ho\u1eb7c I'll )<\/strong> go and shut it.<\/li><li>\" What would you like to drink? \" \" I <strong>will have some<\/strong> coffee, please. \"<\/li><li>\" Did you call Ann? \" \" Oh, no, I forgot. I<strong>'ll do<\/strong> it now. \"<\/li><li>I'm too tired to walk home. I think I<strong>'ll take<\/strong> a taxi.<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p>B\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng <strong>hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\u01a1n<\/strong> (<strong>I do<\/strong>) cho nh\u1eefng c\u00e2u n\u00e0y.<\/p><ul><li>I <strong>will go<\/strong> and shut it. (Kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);\">I go and shut it<\/span>)<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p>Kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong>Will <\/strong>\u0111\u1ec3 n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 vi\u1ec7c ai \u0111\u00f3 <strong>\u0111\u00e3 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh<\/strong> l\u00e0m r\u1ed3i ho\u1eb7c <strong>\u0111\u00e3 s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u00f3. \u1ede \u0111\u00e2y ch\u00fang ta s\u1ebd d\u00f9ng<strong> hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i ti\u1ebfp di\u1ec5n<\/strong> v\u1edbi ngh\u0129a t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai ( xem l\u1ea1i b\u00e0i tr\u01b0\u1edbc )<\/p><ul><li>I can't meet you tomorrow because my parents<strong> are coming<\/strong> to see me. (Kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 <strong>my parents will come<\/strong>).<\/li><\/ul><p>Th\u1ec3 ph\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a <strong>Will l\u00e0 Won't<\/strong> (ho\u1eb7c l\u00e0 <strong>Will not <\/strong>):<\/p><ul><li>\" I'm afraid Mr.Wood can't see you untill 4:00. \" \" Oh, in that case I<strong> won't wait<\/strong>. \"<\/li><\/ul><p><br><\/p><p>Ch\u00fang ta th\u01b0\u1eddng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);\"> <\/span><strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);\">I think I'll ...<\/strong><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);\"> <\/span>ho\u1eb7c<strong style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);\"> I don't think I'll ....<\/strong><strong> <\/strong>khi ch\u00fang ta quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh l\u00e0m 1 vi\u1ec7c g\u00ec \u0111\u1ea5y ngay t\u1ea1i th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u00f3i.<\/p><ul><li><strong>I think I'll stay<\/strong> home this evening.<\/li><li><strong>I don't think I'll go<\/strong> out tonight. I'm too tired.<\/li><\/ul>","contentOrigin":{"ops":[{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"A."},{"insert":" Ch\u00fang ta s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng"},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffff00"},"insert":" "},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffff00","bold":true},"insert":"Will "},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffff00"},"insert":"( vi\u1ebft t\u1eaft l\u00e0 "},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffff00","bold":true},"insert":"'ll"},{"attributes":{"background":"#ffff00"},"insert":" )"},{"insert":" khi ch\u00fang ta quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c g\u00ec \u0111\u00f3 t\u1ea1i th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u00f3i:\nOh, I left the door open. I "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"will (ho\u1eb7c I'll )"},{"insert":" go and shut it."},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"\" What would you like to drink? \" \" I "},{"attributes":{"bold":true},"insert":"will have some"},{"insert":" coffee, please. \""},{"attributes":{"list":"bullet"},"insert":"\n"},{"insert":"\" Did you call Ann? \" \" Oh,